    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28150" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουλᾰγωγ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make a slave, treat as such,</i> dub. in <i><span class="en">
